  "releaseNotes": "- Updated to USWDS 3.14.0\n      - Range slider: prevent USWDS 3.13+ from adding a duplicate value display; added hint (asp-show-hint / asp-hint-text) per USWDS 3.14\n      - Accordion: added asp-icon-position (Default/Start/End). USWDS 3.14 places the icon on the left by default; use End for the previous look.\n      - USWDS 3.14 visible changes to check in consuming sites:\n        - Accordion icons move to the left unless asp-icon-position=\"End\" is set\n        - Breadcrumbs now wrap instead of truncating (add usa-breadcrumb--truncate for the old behavior)\n        - Modals now move focus to the first button in the footer when opened\n        - File input shows only \"Choose from folder\" on phones and other touch devices",
